  {
   "id": "t872332248",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 860.0,
   "y": 600.0,
   "width": 560.0,
   "height": 250.0,
   "strokeColor": "#EAF4FF",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "text": "item_view          THE READ SURFACE\nitem  JOIN  item_user  ON  item_id\neffective_status = status_manual ??\n   (playtime_minutes > 0 ? in_progress : not_started)\nDERIVED, never stored. NULL playtime and 0 playtime\nboth fall to not_started - which is what derive() returns\nfor both, so the derivation needs nothing from code.",
   "originalText": "item_view          THE READ SURFACE\nitem  JOIN  item_user  ON  item_id\neffective_status = status_manual ??\n   (playtime_minutes > 0 ? in_progress : not_started)\nDERIVED, never stored. NULL playtime and 0 playtime\nboth fall to not_started - which is what derive() returns\nfor both, so the derivation needs nothing from code.",
