   "text": "metadata          CACHE  (Phase 2)\nitem_id PK/FK  CASCADE\nsinopse \u00b7 cover_ref \u00b7 released_at\ngenres (JSON)\nsource_provider \u00b7 attribution\nfetched_at NOT NULL - every row\ncarries its own age\ncover_ref CHECKed NOT a URL",
