   "strokeColor": "#EAF4FF",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "text": "mood_tag / item_mood          (Phase 2)\nmood_tag  id PK \u00b7 key UNIQUE \u00b7 label\n           (no applies_to - pruned)\nitem_mood  (item_id, mood_id) PK\n           source  user | inferred    confidence\nONLY source='user' crosses to Phase 4 -\nthe ONE place the line is a column,\nnot a table boundary.",
   "originalText": "mood_tag / item_mood          (Phase 2)\nmood_tag  id PK \u00b7 key UNIQUE \u00b7 label\n           (no applies_to - pruned)\nitem_mood  (item_id, mood_id) PK\n           source  user | inferred    confidence\nONLY source='user' crosses to Phase 4 -\nthe ONE place the line is a column,\nnot a table boundary.",
