   "y": 1450.0,
   "width": 1029.6,
   "height": 18.2,
   "strokeColor": "#FF8A8A",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "text": "disconnect and forbidding disconnect while items exist. Both are wrong, so there is no FK. The association resolves in code, against",
